            "description": "# tgittools - TGIT environment tools\n\nThis package is a set of tools intended to help users and administrators of the TGIT environment.\n\n## Building\n\nTo build the package, you'll need Poetry installed\n`curl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python3 -`\n\nTo install dependencies,\n`poetry install`\n\nIn the project dev environment you can run a script:\n`poetry run tgittools/tgit_ssh_configmaker.py` runs the configmaker\n\n",
